# Service-Yiled

A small browser tool that shows which services earn the most for each hour of staff time.

## Use it

Open `index.html` in any browser. There is nothing to install and no server to run.

1. Enter your staff count and the weekly hours each person works.
2. Add each service with its price, cost, minutes per job, and jobs per week.
3. Read the results, which update as you type.

## What it calculates

- **Profit per available hour**: weekly profit divided by all hours your team could work.
- **Profit per booked hour**: weekly profit divided by hours actually spent on jobs.
- **Capacity in use**: booked hours as a share of available hours.
- **Profit per hour, by service**: ranks each service so you can see which ones to promote and which ones to reprice.

The tool also flags when booked hours exceed capacity, and estimates what the unbooked hours are worth.

## Notes

The sample services are placeholders. Replace them with your own numbers.
